# Runtime debris from running the spikes in-tree. All regenerated on demand by
# v3/spikes/mqtt-infra.sh, and the certs/passwd must never be committed - they
# are throwaway self-signed test material but committing private keys is a habit
# worth not forming (and it trips secret scanners).
v3/spikes/__pycache__/
v3/spikes/mqtt-infra/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
